<title>INDIA: India's HLL 1st half results on Tuesday.</title>
<headline>India's HLL 1st half results on Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hindustan Lever Ltd (HLL), the Indian subsidiary of Anglo-Dutch conglomerate Unilever Plc, said its board will meet at the southern city of Bangalore on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The meeting is to finalise accounts for the first half of 1997, a company spokesman told Reuters on Monday.</p>
<p>Hindustan Lever is the largest multinational firm in India and the country's leading manufacturer of soaps and detergents.</p>
<p>The HLL share is part of the 30-share benchmark Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) index.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
